# ─── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ─── Test / tooling caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ─── Editor / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.kiro/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# ─── Large / redundant data artifacts (exceed GitHub's 100 MB limit) ─────────
# The giant Phase 3 JSON pair dumps are redundant: the canonical, compact
# labelled-pair table is phase3_final_review/pairs.npz (7.6 MB), which IS
# tracked. Regenerate the JSON with scripts/phase3_pipeline.py if ever needed.
pairs/positive_pairs.json
pairs/random_negative_pairs.json
pairs/hard_negative_pairs.json

# Config backups
config/*.bak.*

# ─── Phase 5A training checkpoints (regenerable binary artifacts) ────────────
# Model checkpoints from scripts/train_phase5a.py are throwaway per-fold
# binaries (a full 7-fold run produces 7). The small per-fold history JSONs
# ARE tracked as provenance for the numbers cited in PHASE5_RESULTS_LOG.md;
# the .pt checkpoints are not. Covers every phase5a_runs* output dir.
phase5a_runs*/*.pt
phase5a_runs*/**/*.pt

# ─── Source meshes excluded (kept out of the repo by request) ────────────────
# The raw scans in data/ total ~99 MB. They are inputs, not outputs, and are
# distributed separately. Place them in data/ locally to run the pipeline.
data/*.ply
